<!--
  Three URLs, on purpose. The client reproductions under /c/ are Disallow'd in
  robots.txt (a pixel-faithful /c/damus must not rank for "Damus"), so listing
  them here would ask crawlers to fetch what the same site tells them not to.

  /compare and /docs are the opposite case, and the reason this file has more
  than one line: sourced, dated text about what clients can and cannot do, and
  our own prose about our own site, are ordinary pages rather than clones of
  anyone's product. All three are prerendered (scripts/prerender.mjs) — a
  crawler that runs no JavaScript still gets the whole thing.

  No <lastmod>: a hand-written date goes stale the first time it is forgotten,
  and a lastmod crawlers learn to distrust is worth less than none.
-->
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>https://sandstr.app/</loc>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://sandstr.app/compare</loc>
  </url>
  <url>
    <loc>https://sandstr.app/docs</loc>
  </url>
</urlset>
